      "text": "PROPERTY THRESHOLD\r\nANALYTICAL\r\nMETHOD DESCRIPTION\r\nMONITORING\r\nFREQUENCY\r\nRECOMMEN\r\nOR REQUIRE\r\nD5373 or\r\nStandard Test\r\nMethod for\r\nDetermination of\r\nCarbon, Hydrogen\r\nand Nitrogen in\r\nAnalysis of Solid\r\nBiofuels EN ISO\r\n16948:2015\r\nthe Biochar\r\nProduction and\r\nStorage\r\nProtocol for\r\ncarbon content\r\nsampling\r\nguidance.\r\nsamples per\r\nstorage batch.\r\nInorganic\r\nCarbon\r\nContent\r\n(C )\r\n-\r\nStandard Test\r\nMethod for Rapid\r\nDetermination of\r\nCarbonate\r\nContent of Soils\r\nASTM D4373-02\r\nor Testing of Solid\r\nFuels -\r\nDetermination of\r\nthe Carbonate\r\nCarbon Dioxide\r\nContent DIN\r\n51726:2004-06\r\nMeasurement of\r\ninorganic\r\ncarbon in\r\nbiochar is\r\nrequired to\r\naccurately\r\ndifferentiate C\r\nfrom total\r\ncarbon content,\r\nwhich may\r\ninclude both\r\ninorganic and\r\norganic forms.\r\nOnly C is\r\ncredited for\r\nunder this\r\nProtocol and\r\nModule.\r\nMeasure every\r\nproduction/storage\r\nbatch as per the\r\nguidance in\r\nSection 8.3.1 of the\r\nBiochar Production\r\nand Storage\r\nProtocol. Minimum\r\nnumber of 3\r\nsamples per\r\nstorage batch.\r\nRequired\r\nm - Direct mass\r\nmeasurement with\r\ncalibrated weigh\r\nscales\r\nThe carbon\r\ncontent of\r\napplied biochar\r\nis necessary for\r\nthe\r\nquantification of\r\nMeasure every\r\nstorage batch\r\nRequired\r\ninorg\r\norg\r\norg\r\nbiochar\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in the Built Environment v1.0 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-built-environment/1.0 24/70"
