      "type": "text",
      "text": "PROPERTY THRESHOLD\r\nANALYTICAL\r\nMETHOD DESCRIPTION\r\nMONITORING\r\nFREQUENCY\r\nRECOMMEN\r\nOR REQUIRE\r\nCO e stored, in\r\naccordance with\r\nSection 7.0. See\r\nthe Biochar\r\nProduction and\r\nStorage\r\nProtocol for\r\ncarbon content\r\nsampling\r\nguidance.\r\nMoisture\r\nContent\r\n-\r\nStandard Test\r\nMethods for\r\nDetermination of\r\nMoisture Content\r\nin Analysis\r\nSamples of Wood\r\nCharcoal ASTM\r\nD1762-84 or\r\nStandard Test\r\nMethod for\r\nDetermination of\r\nMoisture Content\r\nin Analysis of\r\nChemical and\r\nPhysical Tests of\r\nSoil Improvers BS\r\nEN 13040:2007\r\nThe moisture\r\ncontent of\r\napplied biochar\r\nis necessary for\r\nthe\r\nquantification of\r\nCO e stored, in\r\naccordance with\r\nthe Biochar\r\nProduction and\r\nStorage\r\nProtocol.\r\nCarbon content\r\ncan be reported\r\non a dry basis to\r\naccount for\r\ndifferences in\r\ntotal biochar\r\nmass.\r\nMeasure every\r\nproduction/storage\r\nbatch as per the\r\nguidance in\r\nSection 8.3.1 of the\r\nBiochar Production\r\nand Storage\r\nProtocol. Minimum\r\nnumber of 3\r\nsamples per\r\nstorage batch\r\nRequired\r\nRandom\r\nReflectance\r\n(R₀)\r\n> 2% White-light\r\nmicroscopy, eg\r\nISO 7404-5:2009\r\nRandom\r\nreflectance is an\r\nindicator of\r\naromaticity,\r\nMeasure every\r\nproduction/storage\r\nbatch as per the\r\nguidance in\r\nRequired\r\n2\r\n2\r\n10,34\r\n03/02/2026, 10:56 Biochar Storage in the Built Environment v1.0 — Isometric\r\nhttps://registry.isometric.com/module/biochar-storage-built-environment/1.0 25/70"
